#: ../../authentication.md:1
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa"

#: ../../authentication.md:3
msgid ""
"Every endpoint except `/health` needs an API key. Send it in the "
"`Authorization` header as a bearer token."
msgstr ""
"Yonke i-endpoint ngaphandle kwe-`/health` idinga i-API key. Yithumele "
"ku-header ye-`Authorization` njenge-Bearer token."

#: ../../authentication.md:9
msgid ""
"The public demo key is `lugha_demo_key`. It is shared and rate limited, "
"so use it for trying things out and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"I-demo key yomphakathi yi-`lugha_demo_key`. Yabelwana ngayo futhi "
"inemikhawulo yokusetshenziswa, ngakho yisebenzise kuphela ukuzama izinto "
"futhi hhayi enye injongo."

#: ../../authentication.md:11
msgid "Keep your key out of your code"
msgstr "Gcina i-key yakho ingekho ku-code yakho"

#: ../../authentication.md:13
msgid "Read the key from an environment variable."
msgstr "Funda i-key ku-environment variable."

#: ../../authentication.md:21
msgid "Three rules keep keys safe."
msgstr "Imithetho emithathu isiza ukugcina ama-key ephephile."

#: ../../authentication.md:23
msgid ""
"Never commit a key to source control. Add any file that holds a key, such"
" as `.env`, to `.gitignore`."
msgstr ""
"Ungalokothi ufake i-key ku-source control. Faka noma yiliphi ifayela "
"eliqukethe i-key, njenge-`.env`, ku-`.gitignore`."

#: ../../authentication.md:24
msgid ""
"Never put a key in code that runs in a browser or a mobile app. Anyone "
"can read it. Call the API from your own server instead."
msgstr ""
"Ungalokothi ufake i-key ku-code esebenza ku-browser noma ku-mobile app. "
"Noma ubani angayifunda. Kunalokho, shayela i-API usebenzisa i-server "
"yakho."

#: ../../authentication.md:25
msgid ""
"Never paste a key into a support message. Send the `request_id` from the "
"error instead."
msgstr ""
"Ungalokothi unamathisele i-key kumlayezo we-support. Kunalokho, thumela "
"i-`request_id` evela ku-error."

#: ../../authentication.md:27
msgid "Rotate keys without downtime"
msgstr "Shintsha ama-key ngaphandle kokumisa isevisi"

#: ../../authentication.md:29
msgid "The service accepts more than one key at a time. To rotate:"
msgstr "Isevisi yamukela ama-key angaphezu kweyodwa ngesikhathi. Ukuwashintsha:"

#: ../../authentication.md:31
msgid "Add the new key alongside the old one."
msgstr "Faka i-key entsha eduze kwendala."

#: ../../authentication.md:32
msgid "Deploy your applications with the new key."
msgstr "Deploy ama-application akho usebenzisa i-key entsha."

#: ../../authentication.md:33
msgid "Remove the old key once nothing uses it."
msgstr "Susa i-key endala uma kungasekho lutho oluyisebenzisayo."

#: ../../authentication.md:35
msgid "If a key leaks, remove it straight away and issue a new one."
msgstr ""
"Uma i-key idaluleka, yisuse ngokushesha bese ukhipha entsha."

#: ../../authentication.md:37
msgid "Authentication errors"
msgstr "Amaphutha okuqinisekisa"

#: ../../authentication.md:39
msgid "Both authentication failures return status `401`."
msgstr "Kokubili ukwehluleka kokuqinisekisa kubuyisa i-status `401`."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "Isizathu"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Okufanele ukwenze"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing, or it does not start with `Bearer`."
msgstr ""
"I-header ye-`Authorization` ayikho, noma ayiqali nge-`Bearer`."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Add the header in the format above."
msgstr "Faka i-header ngendlela eboniswe ngenhla."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The header is well formed but the key is not recognised."
msgstr "I-header yakhiwe kahle kodwa i-key ayaziwa."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Check for typos, extra spaces and expired keys."
msgstr ""
"Hlola amaphutha okuthayipha, izikhala ezengeziwe nama-key aphelelwe isikhathi."

#: ../../authentication.md:46
msgid "Do not retry a `401`. The same request will fail the same way."
msgstr ""
"Ungazami futhi i-`401`. Isicelo esifanayo sizohluleka ngendlela efanayo."